    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the insurance law and the vehicle and traffic law, in relation\nto permitting an insurer to rescind or retroactively cancel a policy in\ncertain circumstances",
    "basePrintNo": "S5052",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5052-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
